    "In spontaneous speech some atone syllables are reduced and words are linked. Not all letters are heard with the same clarity as in a slow reading.",
    "Norwegian dialects can differ a lot in sounds and intonation. Use spelling as a support and practice first with a clear rhythm, without assuming that there is a single standard oral pronunciation."
